Krita Nova 67 - Material Symbols for the icons that have one

Every Krita interface icon that Google's Material Symbols has a matching
icon for (about 290 icons, 583 files: both the dark_ and the light_ variant,
and every size) is replaced by that symbol, Outlined style, in the colors of
Krita's own icons (#373737 for dark_, #d2d2d2 for light_), at the size of the
file it replaces. Icons with no matching symbol (selection modes, timeline,
masks, brush engines, transform modes, path points, ...) and colored or
special pictures (notification dot, Support Krita heart, broken preset,
swap / reset arrows of the color button, the timeline's stripes) are kept.
The mapping: "Krita icons vs Material Symbols" sheet; each replaced file
names its symbol in a comment. krita/pics/MATERIAL_SYMBOLS.txt gives the
license (Apache License 2.0, Google LLC).

