+Krita Nova: many interface icons in this folder (Breeze-*, misc-*, svg,
+tools, tool_transform, layers, layerbox) were replaced by Google's Material
+Symbols (Outlined style, weight 400, no fill), where Material Symbols has an
+icon for the same thing. Each replaced file names its symbol in a comment.
+The dark_ variants are drawn in #373737, the light_ variants in #d2d2d2,
+as Krita's own icons were.
+
+Material Symbols: https://fonts.google.com/icons
